window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-30bc4c9993999e92"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"notifications\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">通知</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>当工作需要你关注时，通知会提醒你。通知的控制选项和发送渠道会因使用界面而异。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"configure-desktop-notifications\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">配置桌面通知</h2> <p>打开 <strong>Settings（设置）</strong>（已阻止不安全链接），选择何时显示任务轮次完成提醒：从不显示、仅在 ChatGPT 位于后台时显示，或始终显示。你还可以分别开启或关闭权限通知和提问通知。操作系统可能会要求你授予 ChatGPT 桌面应用发送通知的权限。</p> <p><a id=\"follow-chats-in-activity-view\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"activity\">在 Activity 视图中跟进聊天</h3> <p>当 <strong>Activity（活动）</strong> 可用时，选择侧边栏中的铃铛，即可查看未读、正在运行或等待你回复的聊天。你也可以在 macOS 上按 <kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>Option</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>，或在 Windows 上按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd>，打开或关闭 Activity 视图。</p> <p>使用该视图的选项来决定显示哪些聊天。根据当前使用界面，可选项可能包括 <strong>Work</strong>、<strong>Chat</strong>、<strong>Pinned</strong> 和 <strong>Scheduled</strong>。你也可以选择 <strong>Mark all as read（全部标记为已读）</strong>，将当前列表中的未读聊天标记为已读。</p> <p><a id=\"follow-task-activity-with-a-pet\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"follow-chat-activity-with-a-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_3\">用宠物跟进聊天活动</h3> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，悬浮宠物是你在其它应用中工作时跟进聊天活动的另一种方式。它可以显示聊天当前是 <strong>Running（运行中）</strong>、<strong>Needs input（需要输入）</strong>、<strong>Ready（已就绪）</strong> 还是 <strong>Blocked（已阻塞）</strong>。</p> <p>请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets（宠物）</a>，了解如何选择宠物、理解它的状态或创建自己的宠物。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"configure-web-notifications\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">配置网页通知</h2> <p>打开 <strong>Settings &gt; Notifications（设置 &gt; 通知）</strong>，管理你的账户可用的通知类别和渠道。根据通知类别和账户，渠道可能包括推送、电子邮件或短信。在任务通知设置中使用 <strong>Manage tasks（管理任务）</strong> 可打开 <strong>Scheduled（定时任务）</strong>。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"configure-cli-notifications\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"cli\">配置 CLI 通知</h2> <p>如需设置终端通知和外部通知，请参阅高级配置指南中的<a href=\"#/article/a-b011aa51b3319b85?anchor=notifications\">通知</a>。你可以选择 TUI 在什么情况下发出通知，以及 Codex 是否在一轮任务完成时运行外部程序。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"follow-task-activity-in-the-ide\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"follow-chat-activity-in-the-ide\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"ide\">在 IDE 中跟进聊天活动</h2> <p>IDE 扩展没有单独的通知控制选项。请保持聊天处于打开状态，以跟进它的活动。如需在一轮任务完成时运行外部程序，请在连接的 Codex 主机上配置 <code>notify</code>。请参阅高级配置指南中的<a href=\"#/article/a-b011aa51b3319b85?anchor=notifications\">通知</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">相关文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-916e12c5bba5b9cc\">长时间运行的工作</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">宠物</a></li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"notifications\">Notifications</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Notifications let you know when work needs attention. Their controls and delivery channels vary by surface.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"configure-desktop-notifications\">Configure desktop notifications</h2> <p>Open <strong>Settings</strong> (blocked unsafe link) to choose whether turn-completion alerts appear never, only while ChatGPT is in the background, or always. Separate controls let you turn permission and question notifications on or off. Your operating system may ask you to grant notification permission to the ChatGPT desktop app.</p> <h3 id=\"follow-chats-in-activity-view\">Follow chats in Activity view</h3> <p>When <strong>Activity</strong> is available, select the bell in the sidebar to see chats that are unread, running, or waiting for your response. You can also open or close Activity view with <kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>Option</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd> on macOS or <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>U</kbd> on Windows.</p> <p>Use the view's options to choose which chats appear. Depending on your current surface, the options can include <strong>Work</strong>, <strong>Chat</strong>, <strong>Pinned</strong>, and <strong>Scheduled</strong>. You can also select <strong>Mark all as read</strong> to clear unread items.</p> <p><a id=\"follow-task-activity-with-a-pet\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"follow-chat-activity-with-a-pet\">Follow chat activity with a pet</h3> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app, a floating pet is another way to follow chat activity while you work in other apps. It can show when a chat is <strong>Running</strong>, <strong>Needs input</strong>, <strong>Ready</strong>, or <strong>Blocked</strong>.</p> <p>See <a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets</a> to choose a pet, understand its status, or create your own.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"configure-web-notifications\">Configure web notifications</h2> <p>Open <strong>Settings &gt; Notifications</strong> to manage the notification categories and channels available to your account. Depending on the category and account, channels can include push, email, or SMS. Use <strong>Manage tasks</strong> from the task notification settings to open <strong>Scheduled</strong>.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"configure-cli-notifications\">Configure CLI notifications</h2> <p>For terminal and external notifications, see <a href=\"#/article/a-b011aa51b3319b85?anchor=notifications\">Notifications</a> in the advanced configuration guide. You can choose when the TUI emits a notification and whether Codex runs an external program when a turn completes.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"follow-task-activity-in-the-ide\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"follow-chat-activity-in-the-ide\">Follow chat activity in the IDE</h2> <p>The IDE extension doesn't provide separate notification controls. Keep the chat open to follow its activity. To run an external program when a turn completes, configure <code>notify</code> on the connected Codex host. See <a href=\"#/article/a-b011aa51b3319b85?anchor=notifications\">Notifications</a> in the advanced configuration guide.</p> <h2 id=\"related-docs\">Related docs</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-916e12c5bba5b9cc\">Long-running work</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets</a></li> </ul>"};
